<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>David Zmick</title>
  <script>
    // before CSS loads the browser paints its own background; that flashes
    document.documentElement.style.backgroundColor =
      window.localStorage.getItem("theme") === "light" ? "#ffffff" : "#1d1f21";
  </script>
  <script type='text/javascript' src='/static/scripts.js' defer></script>
  <link rel='stylesheet' type='text/css' href='/static/base.css' />
  <script>
    // write the right sheet directly, so light mode never loads the dark one
    document.write("<link rel='stylesheet' type='text/css' id='theme-css' href='/static/" +
      (window.localStorage.getItem("theme") === "light" ? "base16-tomorrow" : "base16-tomorrow-night") +
      ".css' />");
  </script>
  <noscript><link rel='stylesheet' type='text/css' id='theme-css' href='/static/base16-tomorrow-night.css' /></noscript>
</head>

<body>
  <div id="preamble" class="status">
    <div id='#preamble'>
      <h1><a href='/'>dpzmick.com</a></h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="content">
    <header>
      <h1>David Zmick</h1>
    </header>

    <p>
    I am currently a software engineer at Jump Trading, living in Chicago.
    </p>

    <p>
    Some code is on <a href="https://github.com/dpzmick">github@dpzmick</a> and <a href="https://gitlab.com/dpzmick">gitlab@dpzmick</a>.
    </p>

    <p>
      Email: david at dpzmick.com
    </p>

    <h2>Projects:</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Modular synthesizer - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYkk_c66qufhHQBpM5wwLaQ">Videos</a></li>
      <li>Building a Homelab</li>
      <li>Undergraduate senior thesis - <a href="./static/ugrad-thesis.pdf">Automatic parallelization of recursive functions in clojure</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Blog Posts: <span id=rss><a href="/feed.xml"><img src="/static/rss.png"></a></span></h2>
    <ul>
    {{ #posts }}
    <li><code>{{ DATE }}</code> - <a href="{{ PERMALINK }}">{{ TITLE }}</a></li>
    {{ /posts }}
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div id="postamble" class="status">
    <div id='#postamble'>
      <a href='/'>home</a>
      <a class='need-js' href='#/' onclick='switchModes()'>switch-color-mode</a>
      <span id='perf-stats'></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>
